//
// vllm-sr/d3-lite Q4NX verify gate: the d3 decision gate (d3_edge/gate.py),
// NPU vs the upstream d3 runtime on CPU with the bundle's Q4K / Q8 values
// dequantized (d3_edge/reference.py --model lite) over the 67 questions of
// d3_edge/requests.json. A question passes with finite option logits, each
// answer in the other's top 2, and equal answers where the reference's top-2
// margin is at least 0.05. d3 has no LM head, so the shared verify/ top-k
// token check does not apply; this is the model's correctness gate. NPU
// weights: FastFlowLM's model.q4nx (FastFlowLM/D3-Lite-NPU2, pinned revision
// and sha256); the reference also loads vllm-sr/d3-lite at its pinned
// revision.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, peano_ge22, hf_token, hfweights_vllm_sr_d3_lite, hfweights_fastflowlm_d3_lite_npu2
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_npu2_verify
// RUN: cd test_npu2_verify
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile compile PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% make -f %S/Makefile verify | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: [d3 gate] PASS 67/67
